<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/014021b160e9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[5858] An AI answer that suggested using \"1/8 cup of non-toxic glue\" to stop cheese from sliding off pizza can be traced back to someone who was obviously trying to troll an ongoing thread." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5858" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/03f48537bf79> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Like some other LLMs, Google's AI search system can sometimes struggle with basic math problems and equations." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5858" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/09f730305344> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[5853] Google unveiled a new feature this month in the US that includes artificial intelligence (AI) generated summaries at the top of its search engine." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5853" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/27a6002003f5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[5858] A Google spokesperson told Ars, \"We conducted extensive testing before launching this new experience and will use these isolated examples as we continue to refine our systems overall.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5858" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/39085f580374> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google earlier this month introduced an AI-generated search results overview tool, which summarizes search results so that users don't have to click through multiple links to get quick answers to their questions." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7425" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3d2af1d72764> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "But already, some have pointed out errors in the information included in the new \"AI Overviews\"." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5853" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4733ea99ae56> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google's AI Overview says yes." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7100" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4de55f9740ef> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Asking about the relative value of dollars in the year 2000, for instance, returns a nonsensical response about \"a cumulative price increase of -43.49%\" between 2000 and 2023 (prices actually went up 77 percent in that time, according to the inflation calculator Google itself cites)." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5858" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5f9f1a68ef55> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[7425] Google confirmed to CNN on Friday that the AI overviews for both queries had been removed for violating the company's policies." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7425" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/810b45674abc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "It's a prime example of a large language model-powered AI tool mangling information as it parses through it, missing important nuances in the source material." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7100" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/865bf6d25fe1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google's new AI summaries tool causes concern after producing misleading responses" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5853" .

