<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b834b93fb8b6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A Google spokesperson told Ars, \"We conducted extensive testing before launching this new experience and will use these isolated examples as we continue to refine our systems overall.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5858" .

