<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/eb7071213e06> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Robert Espinoza, a biology professor at the California State University, Northridge, who is also president of the American Society of Ichthyologists and Herpetologists." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5853" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/022e6290ff72> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In response to questions, a spokesperson for Google told us that \"AI Overviews are dynamic.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7100" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/9ef93e4600ad> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google unveiled a new feature this month in the US that includes artificial intelligence (AI) generated summaries at the top of its search engine." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "5853" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fef08b12fd8d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google confirmed to CNN on Friday that the AI overviews for both queries had been removed for violating the company's policies." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7425" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8c5a8bb94d47> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Google's search overviews are part of the company's larger push to incorporate its Gemini AI technology across all of its products as it attempts to keep up in the AI arms race with rivals like OpenAI and Meta.",
        "Google's search overviews are part of the company's larger push to incorporate its Gemini AI technology across all of its products." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "7425" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7be524fa1022> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The backtracking was a blow to Google's efforts to keep up with its rivals Microsoft and OpenAI, the maker of the ChatGPT chatbot, in the frenzied race to lead A.I." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3701" .

